    "# 🚀 ClipKontrast on Google Colab (Full GPU-Accelerated Workflow)\n",
    "\n",
    "> **Run everything on Colab's GPU** - Process YouTube videos with AI-powered clipping, captions, and GPU-accelerated speech-to-text.\n",
    "\n",
    "Based on ClipKontrast (rebranded PeakCut) - transforms long videos into captioned vertical clips for Reels/Shorts/TikTok.\n",
    "\n",
    "**✨ Features in this Colab version:**\n",
    "- GPU-accelerated speech-to-text (sherpa-onnx with GPU support)\n",
    "- Custom AI model integration (OpenAI-compatible)\n",
    "- Parallel YouTube video processing (2-3 videos simultaneously)\n",
    "- Word-by-word captions in 9:16 vertical format\n",
    "- YouTube transcript-first mode (fast, no full download needed)\n",
    "- Dashboard accessible via Colab link\n",
    "- Clip download after generation"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "metadata": {},
   "execution_count": null,
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# ==========================================\n",
    "# CELL 1: Install Dependencies & Setup\n",
    "# ==========================================\n",
    "\n",
    "# Update apt and install system dependencies\n",
    "%system apt-get update -qq && apt-get install -y ffmpeg 2>&1 | tail -5\n",
    "\n",
    "# Install Python packages - may take a minute\n",
    "%system pip install -q fastapi==0.100.0 uvicorn==0.27.0 httpx==0.25.1 numpy==1.26.4 psycopg==3.1.0 python-multipart sherpa-onnx==2.0.1 soundfile==0.13.2 yt-dlp==2024.10.2 pillow==11.0.0 2>&1 | tail -5\n",
    "\n",
    "# Verify installations\n",
    "import fastapi, uvicorn, httpx, numpy, psycopg, sherpa_onnx, soundfile, yt_dlp, PIL\n",
    "print('✅ All core packages imported successfully!')\n",
    "\n",
    "# upgrade pip and install remaining deps\n",
    "%system pip install -q 'python-multipart>=0.0.32' 2>&1 | tail -3"
   ]
  },
