    "# ==========================================\n",
    "# CELL 8: USER GUIDE - How to Use\n",
    "# ==========================================\n",
    "\n",
    "## 📋 Step-by-Step Workflow:\n",
    "\n",
    "### 1. **AI Key Setup**\n",
    "   - After the dashboard opens, go to **Settings → AI** in the left sidebar\n",
    "   - Verify **Custom** provider is selected\n",
    "   - Your AI key and base URL should be pre-configured from the Colab setup\n",
    "   - Press **Save and Test** to verify the connection\n",
    "\n",
    "### 2. **Paste YouTube URL**\n",
    "   - Open the main dashboard (home screen)\n",
    "   - Find the input field for YouTube/Twitch/Kick URLs\n",
    "   - Paste your YouTube video URL\n",
    "   - Press **Enter** or **Analyze**\n",
    "\n",
    "### 3. **Clip Generation** (GPU-Accelerated)\n",
    "   - **With transcript-first mode** (default): AI reads YouTube's timed transcript,\n",
    "     then downloads only the selected clip sections - **much faster!**\n",
    "   - **Without AI key**: Clips selected by audio loudness only\n",
    "   - **With AI key**: AI selects moments that hold attention (much better clips!)\n",
    "\n",
    "### 4. **Parallel Processing**\n",
    "   - You can process 2-3 videos by pasting them one after another\n",
    "   - The server queues them and processes using Colab's GPU\n",
    "   - Each video typically takes 2-5x real-time with GPU STT\n",
    "\n",
    "### 5. **Download Clips**\n",
    "   - After processing, clips appear in the dashboard\n",
    "   - Each clip has a **Download** button\n",
    "   - Clips are vertical 9:16 format with word-by-word captions\n",
    "\n",
    "### 6. **Connect to Platforms**\n",
    "   - Go to **Settings → Connected Apps**\n",
    "   - You can connect YouTube, Instagram, TikTok\n",
    "   - For custom platforms or manual upload, just download the MP4 files\n",
    "\n",
    "## ⚡ Performance Tips:\n",
    "- **GPU STT**: If Colab shows CUDA available, sherpa-onnx will use GPU for transcription\n",
    "- **Transcript-first**: Set `CLIPKONTRAST_FAST_URLS=1` (default) for fastest processing\n",
    "- **Model caching**: Speech model downloads once (~480MB), subsequent videos are fast\n",
    "- **AI model**: Your custom model's speed depends on the service - test it first!\n",
    "\n",
    "## 🔧 Troubleshooting:\n",
    "- **'Model not found'**: Wait for first download, or re-run the model download cell\n",
    "- **AI key errors**: Verify your custom base URL and key are correct\n",
    "- **ffmpeg missing**: Re-run the dependencies cell\n",
    "- **Timeouts**: Large videos may take longer - be patient on first run"
   ]
  }
